sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant G as Glasses
    participant P as Phone
    participant L as Laptop
    participant C as Cloud
    participant A as Ambient Intelligence

    U->>G: issue intent
    G->>A: forward cue and context
    A->>P: select execution path
    P->>L: hand off complex task
    L->>C: publish result and state
    C->>P: synchronize context
    P->>G: deliver concise follow-up
